msgid "XR Terminology"
msgstr "XR-Terminologie"

msgid ""
"This page defines how terms such as *XR*, *VR*, and *AR* are used within "
"Godot."
msgstr ""
"Auf dieser Seite wird erläutert, wie Begriffe wie *XR*, *VR* und *AR* in "
"Godot verwendet werden."

msgid "XR (Extended Reality)"
msgstr "XR (Extended Reality)"

msgid ""
"**XR** is an umbrella term that covers all extended reality technologies "
"supported by Godot."
msgstr ""
"**XR** ist ein Oberbegriff, der alle von Godot unterstützten Extended-"
"Reality-Technologien umfasst."

msgid "XR includes:"
msgstr "XR umfasst:"

msgid "Virtual Reality (VR)"
msgstr "Virtuelle Realität (VR)"

msgid "Augmented Reality (AR)"
msgstr "Erweiterte Realität (AR)"

msgid "VR (Virtual Reality)"
msgstr "VR (Virtuelle Realität)"

msgid "In Godot, VR typically involves:"
msgstr "In Godot umfasst VR in der Regel:"

msgid "Head-mounted displays (HMDs)"
msgstr "Head-Mounted-Displays (HMDs)"

msgid "Fully virtual 3D scenes"
msgstr "Vollständig virtuelle 3D-Szenen"

msgid "AR (Augmented Reality)"
msgstr "AR (Erweiterte Realität)"

msgid "`ARCore plugin (Android) <https://github.com/godotvr/godot_arcore>`_"
msgstr "`ARCore-Plugin (Android) <https://github.com/godotvr/godot_arcore>`_"
